- Done checklist:
  □ Page follows the page template exactly.
  □ Every feature name matches the app design.
  □ Every rule in the rules file is followed.
  □ Screenshot badge numbers match the numbered list.
  □ Unknowns are marked [TBC: ...], nothing invented.
