4. SHOW ME THE PLAN
One screen with 5 parts: Context, Brain, Job, Rules,
Tools (does on its own / asks first / never). Wait for my OK.

5. BUILD IT
Save it as a Claude Code subagent named document-writer, under 50 lines,
plain English.
- Description: use the words I'd say, e.g. "write a guide page for this
